    &lt;/hdlParameterDescriptorDefinition&gt;
    &lt;hdlParameterDescriptorDefinition&gt;
        &lt;description&gt;0 means writeresponsvalid is disabled, 1 means writeresponsevalid is enabled &lt;/description&gt;
